+## Board publication
+
+Only account admins and owners with access to a board can publish or unpublish it.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes the board and returns `201 Created` with the board JSON, including `public_url`.
+Publishing an already published board keeps the existing link.
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Revokes the public link and returns `204 No Content`. Publishing again creates a new link.
+
+The public pages are read-only and do not require authentication:
+
+- `/public/boards/:key` — the board and its published cards
+- `/public/boards/:key/columns/:id` — a column on the board
+- `/public/boards/:key/cards/:number` — a published card on the board
+
+Drafts, comments, and attachments are not shared through these pages.
+
 ## Board Accesses
 
 Board accesses let you see who has access to a board and their involvement level (watching or access only). Any board member can view this information.
